# .NET build outputs for the rustc-sign-wrapper helper. This subproject
# ships as raw source (Program.cs + RustcSignWrapper.csproj) only — the
# compiled wrapper.exe is produced on demand by `dotnet publish` and the
# Rust build pipeline invokes the wrapper directly, so committing the
# interim build artifacts would just bloat the working tree.
/bin/
/obj/
/*.user
/.vs/
